  </info>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>data_enrichment - asks a local LLM to add a city, state, country, industry and employee range to ten
customer records.
Needs Ollama at OLLAMA_URL with MODEL_NAME pulled, and the GenAI plugins with a GENAI-EE license.

1. csvi-customers: CSV file input, ../data_enrichment_customers.csv, six String fields.
2. ai-template: AI Chat Message Box, prompt field task (the task sentence), run instruction field
   run_instruction (the rules, with ${INDUSTRY_LIST} and ${EMPLOYEE_RANGES} resolved, and the JSON
   shape).
3. js-message: Modified JavaScript value, customer_message = task, then Company:, Email:, Phone: and
   Address: lines.
4. ai-enrich: AI Chat x${STEP_COPIES}, Stream message customer_message, run instruction run_instruction,
   Ollama ${MODEL_NAME} at ${OLLAMA_URL}, temperature 0, numCtx 2048, timeout 120, result llm_json.
5. json-enrich: JSON input from llm_json: city, state, country, industry, industry_basis, employee_range.
6. sv-results: keeps customer_id, name, company_name, address and the six new fields.
7. txt-results: Text file output, customers_enriched.csv beside this file.

Shipped data: 10 customers, 1001 to 1010. city and state are read from each address; industry and
employee_range are the model's estimates.</note>
      <xloc>160</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>626</width>
      <heigth>332</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>10</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
